# Velox Proxima (VP) — CIFAR-10 Example
# Deep dense network on the CIFAR-10 image dataset (flattened).
# Multi-level shape inference with Dropout regularization.

layer Dense (512)
layer Dropout (0.3)
layer Dense (?)
layer Dense (?)
layer Dense (128)
layer Dense (10)
train on cifar10
optimizer adam lr=0.0005
epochs 10
batch_size 128
loss cross_entropy
save models/cifar10_deep.pt
plot all to plots/cifar10_curves.png
eval on test
